      "label_nl": "Word order in questions",
      "part": "1 Friends With Boys",
      "page": 22,
      "section": "grammar",
      "instruction_nl": "Kopvraag \"What kind of personality does Faith have?\" is open: laat leerlingen adjectieven uit opdracht 5 en 6 gebruiken en met de FAQ staven.",
      "items": [
        { "number": "a", "answer": "you — Why do you like comics? / Do you want to work together …? / How much money do you ask …? / Can you give any advice …? / Are you a manga fan?", "note_nl": "Het onderwerp is in elke vraag gemarkeerd." },
        { "number": "a", "answer": "Who — helps you with the drawings? / is the target audience …?" },
        { "number": "a", "answer": "Which characters — in Friends with Boys are autobiographical?" },
        { "number": "b", "answer": "to be", "note_nl": "Questions with … as a main verb do not use the auxiliary to do." },
        { "number": "b", "answer": "subject", "note_nl": "When the question word is (part of) the … of the sentence, you do not use the auxiliary to do." }
      ]
    },
